# A192 — what the semgrep gate resolves, and what it used to hide

## semgrep's own summary, with the --quiet the gate used to pass
semgrep scan --config auto --quiet --json --output semgrep.json Sources tools web
exit=0  log bytes=0  findings=3
(nothing above: --quiet suppresses the summary the gate then had no record of)

